      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 760,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · 业务场景"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · 业务问题"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "context 都在聊天里"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "需求、结论、分工，全是在 IM 里聊出来的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**context 在 IM 里**\n需求、结论和分工都是在群聊里定下来的，而不是在文档里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**模型用不上**\n到了要写需求文档、分工表或汇报材料的时候，模型调用不了这些 context。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "IM 是碎片化的，模型需要干净的上下文"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "所以这个场景归结为两个问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 250,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**碎片化**\n一个需求散在几天的几十条消息里，夹着闲聊，说法也很口语。"
    },
    {
      "id": "nd",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 250,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**模型需要的**\n和当前任务相关、完整、干净的上下文。"
    },
    {
      "id": "two",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 246,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**两个问题**"
    },
    {
      "id": "st",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 902,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 270,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**储存**\n把聊天里的 context 更好地存下来"
    },
    {
      "id": "se",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 902,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 270,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**筛选**\n需要时准确选出对应的 context"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Lark Loom：住在群聊里的 Agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "持续监听，不用 @ 就能感知意图，把讨论变成文档、表格和幻灯片。"
    },
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**群聊**\n团队在这里讨论"
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**持续监听**\n9 类意图，不需要 @"
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Memory**\n结构化的记忆，而不是原始消息"
    },
    {
      "id": "w1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Skill**\n13 个预置之一；只有问答需要 @"
    },
    {
      "id": "w2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**召回**\n从 Memory 里取出这个任务需要的 context"
    },
    {
      "id": "w3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**产出**\n落到飞书多维表格、云文档和幻灯片"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "我负责的两件事"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A：重做了储存和筛选。   B：按子任务的难度分层调用模型。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ta",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**A · 重做储存和筛选**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**原来的做法**\n对原始历史消息做语义相似度检索，取 top-20 给模型。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 284,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**召回会漂**\nIM 太碎，语义相近的不一定是任务需要的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "so",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 572,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**储存**\n用 Seed 1.5 Lite 把消息抽取成结构化的 Memory。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sl",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**筛选，两路**\n- 关键词：精确匹配收敛漂移\n- 任务类型：限定召回范围"
    },
    {
      "id": "ra",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**65% → 80%**\n60 条评测集上的通过率"
    },
    {
      "id": "tb",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**B · 按子任务分层调用模型**"
    },
    {
      "id": "lt",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**确定性处理 → Seed 1.5 Lite**\n上下文抽取、结构化。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 356,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**核心推理和生成 → Seed 2.0 Pro**\n只做这些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 684,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "大模型要读写的 token 更少。"
    },
    {
      "id": "rb",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 926,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**95 秒 → 50 秒**\n单任务 −47%；人工抽检质量无明显差异"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "质量和速度"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "模型有没有把任务做对？回得够不够快？"
    },
    {
      "id": "mq",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**质量**\n评测集上的通过率"
    },
    {
      "id": "mq2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 704,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**从任务出发，而不是从召回出发**\n评测集从完成任务需要什么、以及模型的推理链里提炼出来：拿到这些 context，模型能不能把任务做对？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ms",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**速度**\n单任务平均响应时间"
    },
    {
      "id": "ms2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**为什么重要**\nAgent 住在群聊里。回得太慢，对话的节奏就断了。"
    }
  ],
